

# Subject line: imperative mood, <=50 chars, no trailing period.
# ("Fix", "Add", "Update" -- not "Fixed", "Added", "Updated")
#
# Body (optional, wrap at ~72 cols): explain WHY, not what -- the diff
# already shows what changed. Cover motivation, why this approach over
# alternatives you considered, and what breaks if this is reverted.
#
# BREAKING CHANGE: ...   (delete this line if not applicable)
# Refs: #123             (delete this line if not applicable)
#
# One logical change per commit. Comment lines are stripped automatically.
